invariant: INV-45
file: sha3.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh sha3_round
reason: one lane of the written-out round rotates by 24 places where rho's
  rule gives 25. The round harness compares the round with FIPS 202's
  algorithms, whose offsets come from the standard's formula, for
  every state.

--- old
    uint64_t b12 = rotate_left(a[13], 25);
--- new
    uint64_t b12 = rotate_left(a[13], 24);
